# Frontend Development Roadmap – Smart Canteen 2.0

Your frontend should look like a modern food-ordering application combined with an AI-powered canteen management dashboard.

I recommend building it in 8 phases, starting with the student interface and then developing the kitchen and manager dashboards.

## 1. Decide the frontend technology

For a college project, I recommend:

| Technology   | Purpose                        |
| ------------ | ------------------------------ |
| HTML         | Page structure                 |
| CSS          | Styling and layouts            |
| JavaScript   | Functionality and interactions |
| React.js     | Reusable components            |
| Tailwind CSS | Responsive design              |
| Lucide Icons | Icons                          |

You can use React.js with Tailwind CSS to create a modern, responsive application.

